 actually failing? If so, should I roll it back to v3.3.0?\n2. Should I revert `payments-api` to v5.1.0 if it turns out not to be the cause?\n3. Should I open the SEV2 incident for `payments-worker`, or for both services? Opening it pages on-call, so I held off until you confirm.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01F4hW4pKCEmbDE6osYEbQPP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.7}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01WNGU7qhp5nErZ6TFZadrP3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.7}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The service name \"payments\" wasn't recognized, so I'll try likely variants.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_015BfVx5sDi37UetKvnopNQo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service", "confidence": 0.5}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_018hHxs9hMbq6mPNSLWcJ89J", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service", "confidence": 0.5}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01LvKG1ru8hPuoZXMz4QtZZJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.6}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01UURH3a8QWp5H27uJP8Dkjs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.4}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01LjJAMYM2MFMdTK1f5CUBXP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "paymen